  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "初到昆明的人，往往不到三天，就会学会“是喽嘛”这句话。",
      "output_sha256": "8326507e8e90739c831bd928de74736018bf3546bc7ba796882ce16256b3dc90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.780303,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bf4d725d098900c29043d6a079cfc007350611091ee089682d4a425ac468b0ba"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8326507e8e90739c831bd928de74736018bf3546bc7ba796882ce16256b3dc90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这见出“是喽嘛”在昆明，也许在云南罢，是一句普遍流行的应诺语。",
      "output_sha256": "1b0c962b4abdaf0e57dcf4195eb539c04c26031449b292a58cfd609bb423981d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b0c962b4abdaf0e57dcf4195eb539c04c26031449b292a58cfd609bb423981d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其他地方的应答语虽多，但像“是喽嘛”这样普遍的似乎不多，因而引起了初来者的兴趣。",
      "output_sha256": "fe8caf618e30331ee51ec41caa9d15e278e1344064b39aa6291e246ec77e1760",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.587357,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b5dcd248bc8857a5c5b2cf11462c3fdd9d379ac4b9aeaca9f675c3495b0a4b80"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fe8caf618e30331ee51ec41caa9d15e278e1344064b39aa6291e246ec77e1760",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "初来的人学这句话，一面是闹着玩儿，正和到别的任何一个新地方学着那地方的特别话的心情一样。",
      "output_sha256": "e9df746f4c9c4ab6b25b89f5db4d93fe4ea3f6a10a35c42f7a94f119238152ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "e9df746f4c9c4ab6b25b89f5db4d93fe4ea3f6a10a35c42f7a94f119238152ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "譬如到长沙学着说“毛得”，就是如此。",
      "output_sha256": "d552d9f4fb033c417204cafe830d9155032cbb2be760e18a03c24079d1b420ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "d552d9f4fb033c417204cafe830d9155032cbb2be760e18a03c24079d1b420ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是这句话不但新奇好玩儿，简直太新奇了，乍听不惯，往往觉得有些不客气，特别是说在一些店员和人力车夫的嘴里。",
      "output_sha256": "31dccaba1691b08e5f54294fd38fb9ef3b698413af609e965ee5b09a5dbe93cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "31dccaba1691b08e5f54294fd38fb9ef3b698413af609e965ee5b09a5dbe93cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们本来不太讲究客气，而初来的人跟他们接触最多；一方面在他们看来，初来的人都是些趾高气扬的外省人，也有些不顺眼。",
      "output_sha256": "b2a3974c767b7f2d7c3b4db561bddb3f28b1fd604abf5077b231ed61bdd2693b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2a3974c767b7f2d7c3b4db561bddb3f28b1fd604abf5077b231ed61bdd2693b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这种小摩擦中，初来者听到生疏的“是喽嘛”，不知不觉中对这句话产生了反感，模仿着说出来，也带有一些报复的意味。",
      "output_sha256": "2b894818bbd30a224bf0c90c5779f1c315bdd40690ae01bf2c0ffcb587aae4f4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.559111,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "39f503745937d737bc782cc28da6603be8192d8885b9dfd0db9dea4745f6ae2b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2b894818bbd30a224bf0c90c5779f1c315bdd40690ae01bf2c0ffcb587aae4f4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是喽嘛”有点像绍兴话的“是唉”格嘴，“是唉”读成一个音，那句应诺语乍听起来有时候也好像带些不客气。",
      "output_sha256": "b5be361706ad1f9d7a96a2c297d5c88e50c6ce9ece0bea86179f4bddbc0aaf7a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "b5be361706ad1f9d7a96a2c297d5c88e50c6ce9ece0bea86179f4bddbc0aaf7a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "实际上，这两句话都可以归为平调，虽然与许多其他语言一样，可以强调得不客气，但总体上仍以平调为主。",
      "output_sha256": "a69cc74784cde158752ca1668de897a8bd41027ad58feead573038efc61752e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.512381,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2ce71827d744a35e513ee2586e3c94c28b13bd53d7fcd43a5c27e44af19eb504"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a69cc74784cde158752ca1668de897a8bd41027ad58feead573038efc61752e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在且只就“是喽嘛”来看。",
      "output_sha256": "e7ae183eb8afafae8a332646e05d9d47ede7c8cf06389913f11701dedcd643c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "e7ae183eb8afafae8a332646e05d9d47ede7c8cf06389913f11701dedcd643c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“喽”字大概是“了”字的音转，这“喽”字是肯定的语助词。",
      "output_sha256": "2e37ddb365295b19cb7589587b03f9d6e552fb0d49ae95aa0a0bbfd291c4f38e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e37ddb365295b19cb7589587b03f9d6e552fb0d49ae95aa0a0bbfd291c4f38e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“嘛”字是西南官话里常用的语助词，如说“吃嘛”，“看嘛”，“听嘛”，“睡嘛”，“唱嘛”，还有“振个嘛”，“振”是“这们”的合音，“个”相当于“样”，好像是说“这们着罢”。",
      "output_sha256": "bfea65f331bb11eb55005cbf8b86031e3590a445732c0c3175489d94dcc56df1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "bfea65f331bb11eb55005cbf8b86031e3590a445732c0c3175489d94dcc56df1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是喽”或“是了”并不特别，特别的是另加的“嘛”字的煞尾。",
      "output_sha256": "1e8e98342b0ef665c18e64a8f8d5d09622cc9c43df19d736452d23583d1b788c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e8e98342b0ef665c18e64a8f8d5d09622cc9c43df19d736452d23583d1b788c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这个结尾的助词通常表示祈使语气，可以是客气的请求或不客气的命令。",
      "output_sha256": "f2eef08ed1c92066186fe627a13331e0e316d52a16e853d8abfa3da2a18e1640",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.75849,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3b4eafd723594b5d2ae48e3618187eeba7e142c77c897723567bd5dee563a63f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f2eef08ed1c92066186fe627a13331e0e316d52a16e853d8abfa3da2a18e1640",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在“是喽嘛”这句话里却不一样，这个“嘛”似乎只帮助表示肯定的语气，对于“是喽”有加重或强调的作用。",
      "output_sha256": "0a1b518e398e0e3c808c6fa6eacf33cee713117616a00cbfae871bb338470b07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "0a1b518e398e0e3c808c6fa6eacf33cee713117616a00cbfae871bb338470b07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "或许正因为这个肯定的强调，才让初来者感到反感。",
      "output_sha256": "da1966dbf310c75a61d895ccf9e630f103cdd4d165a44e37f00afddb66f74e44",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.55631,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "16179d78aded59b2caa5a7c3d904a74467b7564cd1c449fc71ed712a23e5958c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "da1966dbf310c75a61d895ccf9e630f103cdd4d165a44e37f00afddb66f74e44",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是日子久了，听惯了，就不觉其为强调了；一句成天在嘴上在耳边的话，强调是会变为平调的。",
      "output_sha256": "bf6a56bc3e89d92af7808b2917dad8174db869f1543adf3dc3e0e0bec030bb2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "bf6a56bc3e89d92af7808b2917dad8174db869f1543adf3dc3e0e0bec030bb2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "昆明人还会说“好喽嘛”，语气与“是喽嘛”相似。",
      "output_sha256": "05d7c9e89b92f3265dc4b50d2c0eca4acff11ec635e54e9939417277cee0260e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.702781,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "42e8fdc9f4514734c2cc6ea1dd647a73abfd9b3624a1c706d93d70dea6fbe275"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "05d7c9e89b92f3265dc4b50d2c0eca4acff11ec635e54e9939417277cee0260e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "昆明话的应诺语还有“是”这一句，也是别地方没有的。",
      "output_sha256": "348d5c5c6398014255f6c68e8645eea8f7042c1341b3638fb6920a489674f496",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "348d5c5c6398014255f6c68e8645eea8f7042c1341b3638fb6920a489674f496",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "它的普遍的程度，不如“是喽嘛”，却在别的应诺语之上。",
      "output_sha256": "22ec2b47775f50641514380ccb2d890210e12e751cd0e043d8ee311de90e4a21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "22ec2b47775f50641514380ccb2d890210e12e751cd0e043d8ee311de90e4a21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "前些时有个云南朋友（他不是昆明人）告诉我，“是”是旧的说法，“是喽嘛”是新的。",
      "output_sha256": "726a07884a573dbfbfd52d9a805d33218c8dc2089690247d105ff41b35617aef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "726a07884a573dbfbfd52d9a805d33218c8dc2089690247d105ff41b35617aef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我怀疑他是根据这两句话的流行程度自行解释的。",
      "output_sha256": "454d33d46598280a5ff62983128cab8a7d2b8d6cd3e3355bf0475b4d8b2249d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.543235,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5a29c565f23cea1499c04121d96db345c2cbb5f21d701d67ba32b9c33ab28df9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "454d33d46598280a5ff62983128cab8a7d2b8d6cd3e3355bf0475b4d8b2249d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "据我的观察，“是”是女人和孩子说的多，是一句客气的应诺语。",
      "output_sha256": "75062bd15c74f54d703f915b9abe292e671cf836cdbef7b24a30f83d03a54ac8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "75062bd15c74f54d703f915b9abe292e671cf836cdbef7b24a30f83d03a54ac8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“是”相当于“是呢”，其中“呢”也作为肯定的语助词。",
      "output_sha256": "12a4836ea851f145c0cbb8f722852f4ec013f47081af4a20a8977bd6d62ccbea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.568435,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "34a5685397229fc83b95dadb0556c550f17ddb76be163961da0aaf0f1099f6fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "12a4836ea851f145c0cbb8f722852f4ec013f47081af4a20a8977bd6d62ccbea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平话读“呢”为“哪”，例如说，“还没有来哪”，“早着哪”，都是平调，可不说“是哪”。",
      "output_sha256": "4aac2b1de697d16c3f69a9dd8e5f8d2588966e5eedc70f1a2299ac1b85a96182",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "4aac2b1de697d16c3f69a9dd8e5f8d2588966e5eedc70f1a2299ac1b85a96182",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "昆明读作“”，显得更为细腻，因此给人一种客气的感觉；而男性不太喜欢说，或许是因此。",
      "output_sha256": "14eb42a732159efd58b77d40a475b81a95b68d527a18ed362b7c93fc21b2184d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.413441,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f385781b03c6f55f81862528d8487ddd00297b38f0f7cda7fb88df6b627b7a92"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "14eb42a732159efd58b77d40a475b81a95b68d527a18ed362b7c93fc21b2184d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "从字音上说，“喽”字的子音（l）比“”字的子音（n）硬些，“嘛”字的母音（a）比“”字的母音（ei）宽些，所以“喽嘛”这个语助词显得粗鲁些。",
      "output_sha256": "fb9dabeefeec590865ebb25163d2aa6f28b6f760cf10a9849f2b7cae18a89344",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "fb9dabeefeec590865ebb25163d2aa6f28b6f760cf10a9849f2b7cae18a89344",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是喽嘛”这句话，若将“是”字或“嘛”字重读或拖长，就真成了不客气的强调。",
      "output_sha256": "f924f7c96f929c1882cd6babca2b755e1bf52b0bb38ec3035df2c533920cdd6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "f924f7c96f929c1882cd6babca2b755e1bf52b0bb38ec3035df2c533920cdd6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "听的人觉得是在受教训似的，像一位前辈先生老气横秋的向自己说，“你的话算说对啦！”",
      "output_sha256": "9df841e0bdfb10824f04f0f068d68e341abb9ce4091b4361f93532f640ac9fa9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "9df841e0bdfb10824f04f0f068d68e341abb9ce4091b4361f93532f640ac9fa9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要不然，就会觉得说话的是在厌烦自己似的，他好像是说，“得勒，别废话啦！”",
      "output_sha256": "725318261939bb39984a50c1f09f347aee44724a3bebb7ebf7f8ce6e782e2079",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "725318261939bb39984a50c1f09f347aee44724a3bebb7ebf7f8ce6e782e2079",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是”这句话却不相同，它带点儿嫩气，总是客客气气的。",
      "output_sha256": "d71e3a53076afc2bb9520d001e59ae982101af0904cc2e0ccc6f9e53e47509b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "d71e3a53076afc2bb9520d001e59ae982101af0904cc2e0ccc6f9e53e47509b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "昆明人也会说“好”，与“好喽嘛”的语气差别，跟两个“是”字句的区别相似。",
      "output_sha256": "6b8a4f821f37fafe4037b1e8e2ecc0b6a005807727c664ecfee0a07f79919558",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.589031,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9d540c5641f0595838a5ff6ef867c1c3a5293dfe042822e27a432d6b4144e780"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6b8a4f821f37fafe4037b1e8e2ecc0b6a005807727c664ecfee0a07f79919558",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "昆明话的应诺语，据我所听到的，还有两个。",
      "output_sha256": "00b33d8094849245dc3a8ed26010d9b699cc7859717ab02ca5a3539db6c46850",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "00b33d8094849245dc3a8ed26010d9b699cc7859717ab02ca5a3539db6c46850",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个是“是噢！”",
      "output_sha256": "8829d1f4a5080d3092742dbb9e841d8e55f269bb4b08f06bb0a9c32984202a51",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "8829d1f4a5080d3092742dbb9e841d8e55f269bb4b08f06bb0a9c32984202a51",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "，说起来有些类似于一个轻声的“少”字。",
      "output_sha256": "063d8c574f80b75914d7945269d003aed4720f6fd127c12d446382de2ac65e0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.527537,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8b62d122bd6b12e716bf9856b80231b424fb695ec95405a30dcb10de8d2335f1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "063d8c574f80b75914d7945269d003aed4720f6fd127c12d446382de2ac65e0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这是下对上的应答语，类似北平的“着”字，但使用频率很低，远不如北平的“着”字普遍。",
      "output_sha256": "ff614d2b34d0b89fe74704229c31612097701e6c9783a32e0c3a2a72483ee93c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.601667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bf2e84244851f3842ce0f373633e67c061cfaf05c6feef2ebfc45f4dcf2a8807"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ff614d2b34d0b89fe74704229c31612097701e6c9783a32e0c3a2a72483ee93c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "又一个是“是的喽”。",
      "output_sha256": "3d6a2887249575015a6c645c4c5da5e838af73f8e6a0545316444bf6fee74fbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d6a2887249575015a6c645c4c5da5e838af73f8e6a0545316444bf6fee74fbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有一次我经过菜市场，听见一位外省口音的女士对一位卖东西的女人说：“我经常买你的！”",
      "output_sha256": "e0899e289803a8bf718d0d0922d067ded964200ab3bf6532a9cef97734c6c021",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.677009,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "61e4bfdae0e504752203c7370a6ed89fa18dc82009b2afed2f87f8d05ebca53a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e0899e289803a8bf718d0d0922d067ded964200ab3bf6532a9cef97734c6c021",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那女人应着“是的喽”，下文却不知怎么样。",
      "output_sha256": "1f35689cdd2cdd09ce3a6477d64cd56b8907ddb79d4bc73b97add0fafbdac3fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f35689cdd2cdd09ce3a6477d64cd56b8907ddb79d4bc73b97add0fafbdac3fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这句话似乎也是强调转为平调的，其他地方也可能有类似的用法。",
      "output_sha256": "8f83f10cd5b3b2ed2425c13e4dd1edefa70c0fd44beac6a4e2d3949199bf4ea0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.546096,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0daecec2cf0d10b427c7f780426e3826227ad8e8916fde6a0aa338f6e7cbfd5e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8f83f10cd5b3b2ed2425c13e4dd1edefa70c0fd44beac6a4e2d3949199bf4ea0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "提到“着”字，我不禁想起北平的应诺语。",
      "output_sha256": "d8b6b40d398ea6381ffd3e794a1c6606b02c37b0a1b01bb2eda5efb030ebf298",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.625,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d5d87fa587444a943aaaaeb37b826c961ead86d8499ffdd94a69e98c12b143b3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8b6b40d398ea6381ffd3e794a1c6606b02c37b0a1b01bb2eda5efb030ebf298",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北平人说“是得（的）”，是平调。",
      "output_sha256": "a127ce9e36117e5f4592c53b15dc4bbd45900955f82dd7b0d87acb98d11979ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "a127ce9e36117e5f4592c53b15dc4bbd45900955f82dd7b0d87acb98d11979ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“是呀”则带有些同情，听起来像是“你说得对”的意思。",
      "output_sha256": "79d59afa8ac71b1076f6c4d4374d15be1cbf1ea315db7fc109e3429ad5948bbe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.446092,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6f1363b6f2996fcca0a2718e48c145524c6a31013ced1ac45619fb9a33b3784b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "79d59afa8ac71b1076f6c4d4374d15be1cbf1ea315db7fc109e3429ad5948bbe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“可不是！”",
      "output_sha256": "b16e2a0f89158ec92a847d37945935abc41c19e7dbad9a365a4399f7c4be0c51",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "b16e2a0f89158ec92a847d37945935abc41c19e7dbad9a365a4399f7c4be0c51",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“可不是吗！”",
      "output_sha256": "1798bcc4835247462614fea299e405d283d8e7f08ba2448e589b224698071799",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "1798bcc4835247462614fea299e405d283d8e7f08ba2448e589b224698071799",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "比“是呀”同情又多些。",
      "output_sha256": "44d0dfcdfdd84d74097ed615cf0709ab694492665a00b5f537728f95df82edf8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "44d0dfcdfdd84d74097ed615cf0709ab694492665a00b5f537728f95df82edf8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是啊？”",
      "output_sha256": "d13d2b9e6a1a4c1faa65b4ea7c91326ee1d0cd0623a2a4edd3d1ad7d581a9bf9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "d13d2b9e6a1a4c1faa65b4ea7c91326ee1d0cd0623a2a4edd3d1ad7d581a9bf9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "表示有点儿怀疑，也许不止一点儿怀疑，可是只敢或者只愿意表示这一点儿。",
      "output_sha256": "1de1d9e822371e51a0c76f8cd510665b83784b00e0f2a05652576c321dc0ebc9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "1de1d9e822371e51a0c76f8cd510665b83784b00e0f2a05652576c321dc0ebc9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“是吗？”",
      "output_sha256": "28f13112dafdb679b4e031a2b734395fa240ea8091fe8fd37ea77d10e891ea56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "28f13112dafdb679b4e031a2b734395fa240ea8091fe8fd37ea77d10e891ea56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "怀疑就多一些，“是吗！”",
      "output_sha256": "33dc1a911f2a1f46aebc091ca891158e3d884b7c2c4627634cf70c97aa075c79",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "33dc1a911f2a1f46aebc091ca891158e3d884b7c2c4627634cf70c97aa075c79",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "却带点儿惊。",
      "output_sha256": "c38732ff1244e2d2ecbf45f7e539da709228aaa6cf224dae4eeaf7c09ef62da2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "c38732ff1244e2d2ecbf45f7e539da709228aaa6cf224dae4eeaf7c09ef62da2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这些都没有特别的语助词，多少都带有一些客气的意味。",
      "output_sha256": "c90473281c8f5b1d6ba19b970d5145eb3a4beb6d5b6a55593211bb8c0dbe7fd8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
